{"id":851075,"title":"51｜提升文章编写效率","content":"本节课介绍了如何利用科技工具提升文章编写效率。传统方法中，用户通过向GPT等大模型提供提示词来生成文章内容，但受限于token限制，需多次交互才能完成长篇文章。特色工具如Cons R提高了生成效率，支持文件生成功能。演示了使用艾特web方式，通过给定URL让Cons R仿写文章或生成文章骨架。此外，Cons R可作为外挂知识库，帮助生成并引用名人名言。在生成系列文章时，Cons R能够规划目录，并按需补充文章内容。通过Nova模式和Agent模式对比，发现Agent模式在一次性生成多篇内容上更有效率。掌握这些技巧，可以显著提高撰写公众号文章、技术文档及会议记录等的效率。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403859,"user_name":"xuyd","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1050847,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"62E1E7D5201E89","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/08/df/866ed645.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1765162802,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"视频已经有点旧了，跟新版本不太一样","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1096984,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/bd/18/2af6bf4b.jpg","nickname":"兔2🐰🍃","note":"","ucode":"1FEDA044BB6CBD","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677651,"discussion_content":"思路学到了","content_length":15,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1769672481,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}